{
  "SPDX-License-Identifier": "GPL-3.0-only",
  "name": "CHAOS Lab 3 · Orbiting Iron (autoplay FX)",
  "description": "Autoplay, no keyboard: a slow clock opens a curved function envelope that strikes twin VCAs, exposing short metallic CHAOS ring/AM transients against a long stereo delay/reverb trail. CHAOS's gate stays unconnected, while a slow LFO and clocked smooth random destabilize coupling, body tune and roughness frequency. A single oscillator engine plus external FX avoids a phantom looper or voice model. Expose: clock bpm/duty, function rise/fall/curve, CHAOS depth, body_mix, feedback, roughness/rate, internal LFO controls, delay time/feedback and reverb mix. Future internal option: random LFO shape.",
